# Dedao / 得到大脑 web & app first-party hosts.
# Root cause: umiwi CDN was egressing via overseas VPN (LAX edge), making
# native/brain SPA hang while loading large JS/CSS bundles.
# Set this rule set route to 直连 in Anywhere after import/refresh.
# Anywhere types: 0 IPv4 CIDR, 1 IPv6 CIDR, 2 Domain Suffix, 3 Domain Keyword

